<DocPage title="Privacy Policy" description="How VEHA Cloud POS collects, uses and protects your information when you use our website, ads and services." path="/veha-cloud-pos-privacy-policy/">
      <h1>VEHA Cloud POS Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="meta">Last updated: October 2025</p>

      <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
      <p>Welcome to VEHA Cloud POS (“we”, “our”, “us”). We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal information.</p>
      <p>This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect information when you interact with our ads, website, or services.</p>

      <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>We may collect the following types of information:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Contact information</strong> (such as name, phone number, email, or business name) when you fill out a form or message us.</li>
        <li><strong>Usage data</strong> such as how you interact with our ads or website.</li>
        <li><strong>Business information</strong> you provide when inquiring about or using our POS system.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We <strong>do not</strong> collect sensitive payment or financial details through Facebook ads or lead forms.</p>

      <h2>3. How We Use the Information</h2>
      <p>We use the information we collect to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Contact you about our products or services.</li>
        <li>Provide more information, demos, or promotional offers.</li>
        <li>Improve our marketing, communications, and customer experience.</li>
        <li>Comply with Facebook’s advertising and data use policies.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We will <strong>never sell</strong> your personal data to any third party.</p>

      <h2>4. Data Retention</h2>
      <p>We keep your contact details only for as long as needed to provide follow-up communication or service. You can request deletion of your data at any time (see below).</p>

      <h2>5. Sharing of Information</h2>
      <p>Your information is shared only with:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Our authorized staff or marketing partners who help us manage inquiries.</li>
        <li>Facebook or Meta systems that securely process ad data (in compliance with their privacy rules).</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do <strong>not</strong> share data with unrelated third parties.</p>

      <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>You have the right to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Request a copy of your personal information.</li>
        <li>Ask us to correct or delete your data.</li>
        <li>Withdraw consent for further communication.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>To make such a request, please contact us at <a href="mailto:vehacloud@gmail.com">vehacloud@gmail.com</a> or call <a href="tel:+85593923030">093 923 030</a>.</p>

      <h2>7. Security</h2>
      <p>We use reasonable physical, electronic, and administrative safeguards to protect your data from unauthorized access, loss, or misuse.</p>

      <h2>8. Updates to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The latest version will always be available on our official channels or website.</p>

      <h2>9. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy or our data practices, please contact:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Email: <a href="mailto:vehacloud@gmail.com">vehacloud@gmail.com</a></li>
        <li>Phone: <a href="tel:+85593923030">093 923 030</a></li>
        <li>Website: <a href="https://www.veha.app">www.veha.app</a></li>
      </ul>
